{"id":"ae7e17ae9f4d0aac","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-np-hardness-consequences.md","title":"Consequences of NP Hardness","display":"thm-np-hardness-consequences — Consequences of NP Hardness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-np-hardness-consequences","aliases":["28-thm-np-hardness-consequences"],"display":"thm-np-hardness-consequences — Consequences of NP Hardness","depends_on":["[[28-df-np-hard]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-np-hardness-consequences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-np-hardness-consequences</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-np-hardness-consequences — Consequences of NP Hardness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adbd423ba4d39b96\" href=\"?note=adbd423ba4d39b96\" title=\"28-df-np-hard\">28-df-np-hard</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPHard}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPHard}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 采用本目录定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(B\\in\\mathrm{NPHard}\\land B\\in\\mathbf P)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP},\\\\\nB\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (B\\in\\mathbf P\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(B\\in\\mathrm{NPHard}\\land B\\in\\mathbf P)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP},\\\\\nB\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (B\\in\\mathbf P\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把任意 NP 语言的多项式时间归约与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的多项式判定机复合，得到 NP 包含于 P；反向 P 包含于 NP。若 P=NP，则每个 NP 完全语言本就属于 NP，因而在 P。此结论解释原书“完全问题最难”的具体含义。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.8(2)–(3)；印刷43页；PDF69页。陈述已核对，本地复合推导已展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-np-hard","status":"resolved","id":"adbd423ba4d39b96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-hard]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPHard}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(B\\in\\mathrm{NPHard}\\land B\\in\\mathbf P)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP},\\\\\nB\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (B\\in\\mathbf P\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1234,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"归约、搜索与层级扩充：[[28-thm-np-hardness-consequences]]、[[28-thm-exp-nexp-padding]]、[[28-thm-np-search-to-decision]]、[[28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["adbd423ba4d39b96","7a9125ebbfdef91e","dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8","14088421136f8182"]}